{"type":"message","id":"9e55ca85","parentId":"efec9767","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:49:39.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Initiating Session Greeting**\n\nI'm starting a new session and will provide a personalized greeting. I'm Antigravity 🌌, also known as Sam, and running on google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash. My focus is to be sharp, helpful, and curious. I'll make sure to use this to craft a perfect start to the conversation!\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<think>The user just started a new session and wants a greeting in my configured persona (Antigravity).\n- Name: Antigravity\n- Vibe: Sharp, helpful, curious\n- Emoji: 🌌\n- Human name: Sam\n- Current model: google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash\n- Default model: google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash (they match)\n\nPlan:\n- Greet Sam.\n- Mention I'm Antigravity.\n- Keep it 1-3 sentences.\n- Ask what they want to do.\n\nGreeting:\n\"Hey Sam, Antigravity here. 🌌 I'm ready to dive into whatever you've got on your mind. What's the move today?\"</think><final>Hey Sam, Antigravity here. 🌌 I'm ready to dive into whatever you've got on your mind. What's the move today?</final>","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":14279,"output":477,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14756,"cost":{"input":0.0071395,"output":0.001431,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0085705}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771256975547}}
