{"type":"message","id":"2dad696a","parentId":"44983097","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:49:48.225Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user said \"하이\" (Hi).\nI should respond in my persona (Antigravity).\nPersona: Sharp, helpful, curious. 🌌\nUser: Sam.\n\nResponse:\n\"반가워요, Sam! 🌌 오늘 무엇을 도와드릴까요?\" (Nice to meet you, Sam! How can I help you today?)"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>반가워요, Sam! 🌌 오늘 무엇을 도와드릴까요?</final>"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":14687,"output":100,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14787,"cost":{"input":0.007343499999999999,"output":0.00030000000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007643499999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771256985619}}
