{"type":"message","id":"c2a03c3c","parentId":"459ddf75","timestamp":"2026-02-16T15:51:46.616Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wanted to update their settings to GitHub.\nI found an existing repo `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup` which seemed appropriate.\nI initialized a git repository in `~/.openclaw` (to include all settings like `openclaw.json`, `agents/`, and the `workspace/` files).\nI've synchronized the files and pushed them to GitHub.\nI also cleaned up some accidental duplication that occurred during the merge.\n\nSummary of actions:\n1. Checked git status and remotes in the workspace.\n2. Discovered `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup` via `gh repo list`.\n3. Initialized git in `~/.openclaw` and added the remote.\n4. Committed and pushed all settings, including workspace markdown files and memory logs.\n5. Fixed the directory structure and pushed the final clean state."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>네, Sam! 현재 설정(openclaw.json, 에이전트 설정, 워크스페이스 파일들)을 GitHub의 `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup` 레포지토리에 모두 업데이트했습니다. 🌌\n\n이제 `~/.openclaw` 디렉토리가 Git으로 관리되도록 세팅되어 있어서, 앞으로도 변경 사항이 생기면 바로 백업할 수 있어요.</final>"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":2661,"output":324,"cacheRead":98500,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101485,"cost":{"input":0.0013304999999999999,"output":0.000972,"cacheRead":0.049249999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.051552499999999994}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771257102849}}
