{"type":"message","id":"c99beea5","parentId":"c2e26a7b","timestamp":"2026-02-16T22:29:23.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying Plugin Status**\n\nI'm currently checking if all plugins and skills are in a normal operational state. I'm focusing on the status following the morning briefing and the security audit. The output from `openclaw status` is the primary source of information at this stage.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1771280962921_69","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin/openclaw status --deep"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":109234,"output":367,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109601,"cost":{"input":0.054617,"output":0.001101,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.055718}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771280958388}}
{"type":"message","id":"841f4f31","parentId":"c99beea5","timestamp":"2026-02-16T22:29:28.055Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1771280962921_69","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw status\n\nOverview\n┌─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Item            │ Value                                                                                             │\n├─────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Dashboard       │ http://127.0.0.1:18789/                                                                           │\n│ OS              │ linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2 (x64) · node 22.22.0                                     │\n│ Tailscale       │ off                                                                                               │\n│ Channel         │ dev (config)                                                                                      │\n│ Update          │ pnpm · npm latest 2026.2.15                                                                       │\n│ Gateway         │ local · ws://127.0.0.1:18789 (local loopback) · reachable 12ms · auth token · Lfantasial4090      │\n│                 │ (172.26.127.117) app unknown linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2                             │\n│ Gateway service │ systemd installed · enabled · running (pid 24222, state active)                                   │\n│ Node service    │ systemd not installed                                                                             │\n│ Agents          │ 1 · no bootstraps · sessions 5 · default main active just now                                     │\n│ Memory          │ enabled (plugin memory-core) · unavailable                                                        │\n│ Probes          │ enabled                                                                                           │\n│ Events          │ none                                                                                              │\n│ Heartbeat       │ 30m (main)                                                                                        │\n│ Last heartbeat  │ skipped · 28m ago ago · unknown                                                                   │\n│ Sessions        │ 5 active · default gemini-3-flash (200k ctx) · ~/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/sessions.json     │\n└─────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nSecurity audit\nSummary: 0 critical · 1 warn · 1 info\n  WARN Reverse proxy headers are not trusted\n    gateway.bind is loopback and gateway.trustedProxies is empty. If you expose the Control UI through a reverse proxy, configure trusted proxies so local-client c…\n    Fix: Set gateway.trustedProxies to your proxy IPs or keep the Control UI local-only.\nFull report: openclaw security audit\nDeep probe: openclaw security audit --deep\n\nChannels\n┌──────────┬─────────┬────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Channel  │ Enabled │ State  │ Detail                                                                                │\n├──────────┼─────────┼────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Telegram │ ON      │ OK     │ token config (8383…8e8Q · len 46) · accounts 1/1                                      │\n└──────────┴─────────┴────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nSessions\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────┬──────────┬────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n│ Key                                                          │ Kind   │ Age      │ Model          │ Tokens          │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────┼──────────┼────────────────┼─────────────────┤\n│ agent:main:main                                              │ direct │ just now │ gemini-3-flash │ 109k/200k (54%) │\n│ agent:main:cron:eb4407c8-7e9a-4…                             │ direct │ 29m ago  │ gemini-3-flash │ 8.6k/200k (4%)  │\n│ agent:main:cron:eb4407c8-7e9a-4…                             │ direct │ 29m ago  │ gemini-3-flash │ 8.6k/200k (4%)  │\n│ agent:main:cron:78f50a18-690a-4…                             │ direct │ 4h ago   │ gemini-3-flash │ 9.9k/200k (5%)  │\n│ agent:main:cron:78f50a18-690a-4…                             │ direct │ 4h ago   │ gemini-3-flash │ 9.9k/200k (5%)  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────┴──────────┴────────────────┴─────────────────┘\n\nHealth\n┌──────────┬───────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Item     │ Status    │ Detail                                                                                       │\n├──────────┼───────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Gateway  │ reachable │ 918ms                                                                                        │\n│ Telegram │ OK        │ ok (@Lfantabot:default:918ms)                                                                │\n└──────────┴───────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nFAQ: https://docs.openclaw.ai/faq\nTroubleshooting: https://docs.openclaw.ai/troubleshooting\n\nNext steps:\n  Need to share?      openclaw status --all\n  Need to debug live? openclaw logs --follow\n  Need to test channels? openclaw status --deep"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4544,"aggregated":"OpenClaw status\n\nOverview\n┌─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────