{"type":"message","id":"4d9a7e47","parentId":"2c437434","timestamp":"2026-02-17T05:07:43.858Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the 70th birthday (칠순) of someone born in 1958.\n- Birth year: 1958\n- 70th birthday (칠순) is traditionally when the person turns 70 years old (Korean age) or 69 years old (Western age).\n- In Korea, 칠순 is celebrated when the person turns 70 years old in Korean age (Se-neun-nai).\n- Formula for Korean age 70: Birth Year + 69.\n- 1958 + 69 = 2027.\n\nWait, let's verify.\n1958 (1 year old)\n1959 (2)\n...\n2027 (70)\nCorrect.\n\nSo, the 70th birthday (칠순) for someone born in 1958 is in **2027**.\nThe 1958 zodiac is the Dog (무술년).\n\nLet's check the current year: 2026.\nSo it's next year."},{"type":"text","text":"1958년생(무술년, 개띠)이신 분들의 **칠순(만 69세, 한국 나이 70세)**은 **2027년**입니다. 🌌\n\n현재가 2026년이니 바로 **내년**이 칠순이 되시는 해네요!\n\n*   **환갑**: 2018년 (이미 지남)\n*   **칠순(고희)**: **2027년** (내년)\n*   **팔순(산수)**: 2037년\n\n내년에 큰 경사가 있으시겠군요! 🎂"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":115106,"output":393,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115499,"cost":{"input":0.057553,"output":0.001179,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.058732}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771304859438}}
