gular.ttf"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":8,"aggregated":"ArsenalSC-OFL.txt\nArsenalSC-Regular.ttf\nBigShoulders-Bold.ttf\nBigShoulders-OFL.txt\nBigShoulders-Regular.ttf\nBoldonse-OFL.txt\nBoldonse-Regular.ttf\nBricolageGrotesque-Bold.ttf\nBricolageGrotesque-OFL.txt\nBricolageGrotesque-Regular.ttf\nCrimsonPro-Bold.ttf\nCrimsonPro-Italic.ttf\nCrimsonPro-OFL.txt\nCrimsonPro-Regular.ttf\nDMMono-OFL.txt\nDMMono-Regular.ttf\nEricaOne-OFL.txt\nEricaOne-Regular.ttf\nGeistMono-Bold.ttf\nGeistMono-OFL.txt\nGeistMono-Regular.ttf\nGloock-OFL.txt\nGloock-Regular.ttf\nIBMPlexMono-Bold.ttf\nIBMPlexMono-OFL.txt\nIBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf\nIBMPlexSerif-Bold.ttf\nIBMPlexSerif-BoldItalic.ttf\nIBMPlexSerif-Italic.ttf\nIBMPlexSerif-Regular.ttf\nInstrumentSans-Bold.ttf\nInstrumentSans-BoldItalic.ttf\nInstrumentSans-Italic.ttf\nInstrumentSans-OFL.txt\nInstrumentSans-Regular.ttf\nInstrumentSerif-Italic.ttf\nInstrumentSerif-Regular.ttf\nItaliana-OFL.txt\nItaliana-Regular.ttf\nJetBrainsMono-Bold.ttf\nJetBrainsMono-OFL.txt\nJetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf\nJura-Light.ttf\nJura-Medium.ttf\nJura-OFL.txt\nLibreBaskerville-OFL.txt\nLibreBaskerville-Regular.ttf\nLora-Bold.ttf\nLora-BoldItalic.ttf\nLora-Italic.ttf\nLora-OFL.txt\nLora-Regular.ttf\nNationalPark-Bold.ttf\nNationalPark-OFL.txt\nNationalPark-Regular.ttf\nNothingYouCouldDo-OFL.txt\nNothingYouCouldDo-Regular.ttf\nOutfit-Bold.ttf\nOutfit-OFL.txt\nOutfit-Regular.ttf\nPixelifySans-Medium.ttf\nPixelifySans-OFL.txt\nPoiretOne-OFL.txt\nPoiretOne-Regular.ttf\nRedHatMono-Bold.ttf\nRedHatMono-OFL.txt\nRedHatMono-Regular.ttf\nSilkscreen-OFL.txt\nSilkscreen-Regular.ttf\nSmoochSans-Medium.ttf\nSmoochSans-OFL.txt\nTektur-Medium.ttf\nTektur-OFL.txt\nTektur-Regular.ttf\nWorkSans-Bold.ttf\nWorkSans-BoldItalic.ttf\nWorkSans-Italic.ttf\nWorkSans-OFL.txt\nWorkSans-Regular.ttf\nYoungSerif-OFL.txt\nYoungSerif-Regular.ttf","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771321762057}}
{"type":"message","id":"0917a8a3","parentId":"d676e467","timestamp":"2026-02-17T09:49:29.866Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Defining Lunar Resonance**\n\nI'm solidifying the \"Lunar Resonance\" design philosophy for the New Year card; it will be sophisticated. I'm moving toward using the `canvas` declaration and will work with the Present/eval/snapshot of it. It's time to create the image.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write_1771321769130_78","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Design Philosophy: Eternal Horizon\n\n**Eternal Horizon** is an aesthetic movement that seeks to bridge the gap between ancient cultural symbols and the crisp, mathematical precision of modern minimalism. It is a philosophy of balance, where the weight of history is supported by the lightness of contemporary space. In this movement, form is not just a shape, but a container for time.\n\nThe spatial language of **Eternal Horizon** is defined by expansive negative space that allows every element to breathe. Compositions are anchored by a powerful horizontal axis, evoking the serenity of a rising sun over a calm sea or a distant mountain range. This horizon line serves as the foundation for vertical interventions—refined graphics and precise markers that punctuate the void with intentionality.\n\nThe color palette is derived from natural materials and atmospheric transitions: the deep ink-black of ancient calligraphy, the soft celadon-green of weathered stone, and the vibrant, translucent crimson of a low winter sun. These colors are used chromatically to establish hierarchy and mood, never competing, only harmonizing. Materiality is suggested through subtle textures—grain like handmade Hanji paper or the slight bleed of ink on silk.\n\nCraftsmanship is the heartbeat of this philosophy. Every curve is the result of meticulous calibration, and every pixel is placed with painstaking care. The final work must appear as if it were labored over for countless hours by a master artisan at the absolute peak of their field. There is a profound reverence for the \"unseen work\"—the invisible grid, the perfect alignment, and the deliberate restraint that characterizes professional execution.\n\nInformation is communicated through visual rhythm rather than dense text. Typography is treated as a sculptural element, integrated into the architecture of the page. Thin, high-contrast serifs meet technical mono-spaced accents, creating a dialogue between the poetic and the precise. Every marker and label is a testament to expert-level orchestration, rewarding the viewer with details that reveal themselves only upon sustained observation.\n\nThis is an artifact of quiet power, a museum-quality expression of human experience mapped through the lens of systematic beauty. It is a testament to the idea that the ephemeral can be made permanent through careful attention and masterful design.\n","path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/eternal_horizon_philosophy.md"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":7710,"output":710,"cacheRead":117095,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125515,"cost":{"input":0.003855,"output":0.00213,"cacheRead":0.058547499999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.06453249999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771321762061}}
{"type":"message","id":"e33f6878","parentId":"0917a8a3","timestamp":"2026-02-17T09:49:29.872Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"write_1771321769130_78","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 2395 bytes to /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/eternal_horizon_philosophy.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771321769870}}
{"type":"message","id":"e701be64","parentId":"e33f6878","timestamp":"2026-02-17T09:49:45.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Envisioning the Canvas**\n\nI'm now figuring out how to manifest this idea visually, specifically using the `canvas` tool. The documentation for the `canvas` tool looks promising: I'll use `canvas.eval` to integrate p5.js, aiming to render the concept directly onto the canvas.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"canvas_1771321784633_79","name":"canvas","arguments":{"code":"\nconst canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\ncanvas.width = 1200;\ncanvas.height = 1800;\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n// 1. Background\nctx.fillStyle = '#fdfaf5'; // Soft cream\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 1200, 1800);\n\n// 2. Subtle Sun\nconst grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(600, 300, 0, 600, 300, 400);\ngrad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(235, 77, 75, 0.4)');\ngrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(235, 77, 75, 0)');\nctx.fillStyle = grad;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.arc(600, 300, 400, 0, Math.PI * 2);\nctx.fill();\n\n// 3. Mountains (Minimalist)\nctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(47, 53, 66, 0.05)';\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(0, 1200);\nctx.lineTo(300, 800);\nctx.lineTo(600, 1200);\nctx.lineTo(900, 900);\nctx.lineTo(1200, 1200);\nctx.lineTo(1200, 1800);\nctx.lineTo(0, 1800);\nctx.fill();\n\n// 4. Horses (Year of the Horse 2026)\nfunction drawHorse(x, y, scale, flip = false) {\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(x, y);\n    if (flip) ctx.scale(-1, 1);\n    ctx.scale(scale, scale);\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#2f3542';\n    // Abstract body\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.ellipse(0, 0, 40, 20, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    // Neck & Head\n    ctx.moveTo(30, -5);\n    ctx.quadraticCurveTo(50, -30, 45, -50);\n    ctx.lineTo(60, -45);\n    ctx.lineTo(55, -25);\n    // Legs\n    ctx.moveTo(-20, 10); ctx.lineTo(-25, 40);\n    ctx.moveTo(-10, 15); ctx.lineTo(-12, 45);\n    ctx.moveTo(10, 15); ctx.lineTo(12, 45);\n    ctx.moveTo(20, 10); ctx.lineTo(25, 40);\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n}\ndrawHorse(1000, 1650, 1.2);\ndrawHorse(850, 1680, 0.8, true);\n\n// 5. Text - Using custom fonts if possible, else falling back\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nctx.fillStyle = '#1e272e';\n\n// Title\nctx.font = 'bold 54px serif';\nctx.fillText('조승환 부장님, 여승주 부장님!!', 600, 650);\n\n// Body\nctx.font = '32px serif';\nconst lines = [\n    '2026년 병오년 새해 복 많이 받으십시오.',\n    '새해에는 하시는 일 모두 건승하시길 진심으로 기원합니다.',\n    '',\n    '건강과 가족이 무엇보다도 제일 중요하니,',\n    '올 한 해 항상 건강하시고 가정에 화목이 깃들길 바랍니다.',\n    '',\n    '조만간 다시 다 같이 일할 수 있는 기회가 생기면 좋겠습니다!'\n];\nlines.forEach((line, i) => {\n    ctx.fillText(line, 600, 750 + (i * 60));\n});\n\n// Sender\nctx.font = 'bold 36px serif';\nctx.fillText('박찬주 배상', 600, 1300);\n\n// 6. Logos (Placeholder modern style)\nconst logos = ['CSWind', 'Microsoft', 'AWS', 'Azure', 'Gemini'];\nctx.font = '24px sans-serif';\nconst startX = 600 - (logos.length * 100) / 2;\nlogos.forEach((logo, i) => {\n    ctx.fillText(logo, startX + (i * 120), 1450);\n});\n\n// 7. Accents (Mae-hwa)\nfunction drawBlossom(x, y) {\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#eb4d4b';\n    for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        const ang = (i * Math.PI * 2) / 5;\n        ctx.arc(x + Math.cos(ang) * 10, y + Math.sin(ang) * 10, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n    }\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#f0932b';\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(x, y, 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.fill();\n}\ndrawBlossom(100, 400);\ndrawBlossom(150, 450);\ndrawBlossom(1100, 200);\n\n// Save output\nconst data = canvas.toDataURL('image/png');\nA2UI.saveMedia(data, 'new_year_card_2026.png');\n","action":"eval"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":8487,"output":1705,"cacheRead":117130,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":127322,"cost":{"input":0.0042435,"output":0.005115,"cacheRead":0.058565,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0679235}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771321769872}}
