{"type":"message","id":"116c6d78","parentId":"99ddaea2","timestamp":"2026-02-17T09:50:22.819Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering Presentation Context**\n\nI'm hitting a snag trying to use the canvas tool because I can't find linked nodes. I'm focusing now on how to present the visualization, specifically considering if I'm on a web-based canvas (using `canvas.present`) or whether a Telegram session requires a different display approach. I realize I won't have a \"canvas\" UI in Telegram.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"write_1771321821833_84","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>New Year Card 2026</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;\n            background-color: #f9f6f2;\n            width: 1200px;\n            height: 1800px;\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 100px 50px;\n            color: #1e272e;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .hanji-texture {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\n            opacity: 0.05;\n            background-image: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/handmade-paper.png');\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .sun {\n            width: 250px;\n            height: 250px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0932b, #eb4d4b);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(235, 77, 75, 0.3);\n            margin-top: 50px;\n        }\n        .mountains {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 600px;\n            background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(47, 53, 66, 0.05));\n            clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 0 80%, 20% 60%, 40% 90%, 60% 50%, 80% 85%, 100% 70%, 100% 100%);\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n        .content {\n            text-align: center;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n        .title {\n            font-size: 64px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 80px;\n            letter-spacing: -1px;\n        }\n        .body-text {\n            font-size: 42px;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n        .signature {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-top: 100px;\n        }\n        .logos {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 60px;\n            margin-top: 150px;\n            opacity: 0.7;\n        }\n        .logo-item {\n            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 28px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .logo-box {\n            width: 24px; height: 24px;\n            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n        }\n        .logo-box div { width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 1px; }\n        .horse-icon {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 100px;\n            right: 150px;\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            transform: scale(4);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"hanji-texture\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sun\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mountains\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <h1 class=\"title\">조승환 부장님, 여승주 부장님!!</h1>\n        <div class=\"body-text\">\n            <p>2026년 병오년 새해 복 많이 받으시고</p>\n            <p>새해에는 하시는 일 모두 건승하시길 기원합니다.</p>\n            <br>\n            <p>건강과 가족이 무엇보다도 <strong>제일</strong> 중요하니</p>\n            <p>항상 건강하시고 가정에 화목이 <strong>깃들길</strong> 기원합니다.</p>\n            <br>\n            <p>조만간 다시 다 같이 일할 수 있는 기회가 생기면 좋겠네요!</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"signature\">박찬주 배상</div>\n\n        <div class=\"logos\">\n            <div class=\"logo-item\">CSWind</div>\n            <div class=\"logo-item\">\n                <div class=\"logo-box\">\n                    <div style=\"background:#f35325\"></div><div style=\"background:#81bc06\"></div>\n                    <div style=\"background:#05a6f0\"></div><div style=\"background:#ffba08\"></div>\n                </div>\n                Microsoft\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"logo-item\" style=\"text-transform: lowercase;\">aws</div>\n            <div class=\"logo-item\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#0089D6\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 19h20L12 2z\"/></svg>\n                Azure\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"logo-item\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#1a73e8\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 14.5v-9l6 4.5-6 4.5z\"/></svg>\n                Gemini\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"horse-icon\">🐎</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/new_year_card.html"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":135183,"output":2004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":137187,"cost":{"input":0.0675915,"output":0.006012,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0736035}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771321808479}}
