{"type":"message","id":"974dbc5d","parentId":"e02c018d","timestamp":"2026-02-17T09:54:26.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"message_1771322066119_104","name":"message","arguments":{"message":"죄송합니다, Sam! 🌌 시스템에 한국어 폰트가 설치되어 있지 않아 글자가 깨져서 보였네요. \n\n방금 **나눔고딕(NanumGothic)** 폰트를 긴급하게 설치해서 디자인을 다시 생성했습니다. 이제 부장님들의 성함과 메시지가 아주 깔끔하게 잘 보일 거예요. 🐎\nMEDIA:/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/final_new_year_card.png","action":"send","to":"telegram:5487758242"},"thoughtSignature":"EjQKMgG+Pvb7SqgL/lePt2oDQVdHTSL/PJRwXtLKe4bv/FZYjp9c3gK4J0MPTrWHTCFoUlgJ"},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":2635,"output":137,"cacheRead":137834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":140606,"cost":{"input":0.0013174999999999999,"output":0.000411,"cacheRead":0.06891699999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.07064549999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771322058269}}
