{"type":"message","id":"cde53584","parentId":"0af92356","timestamp":"2026-02-17T15:39:01.199Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"write_1771342741183_114","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-02-18.md","content":"# 2026-02-18\n\n- **GitHub Backup Success**: Successfully synced the entire OpenClaw configuration and workspace (`~/.openclaw`) to the private repository `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup`.\n- **System Diagnosis**: Verified that while the core system is healthy, the `Memory` plugin is currently unavailable due to a missing embedding API key.\n- **Odin Inventory**: Created and saved `odin_items.md` containing detailed game item lists for Loki 7 and other sub-accounts.\n- **Design Work**: Produced a sophisticated 2026 New Year's card (\"Eternal Horizon\") after troubleshooting Korean font issues by installing `NanumGothic`.\n- **Notion Integration**: Configured Notion API access using a provided integration token. Successfully read and summarized a task database containing ITAM, DevSecOps, and CAPEX related items.\n- **Tools Updated**: Recorded the Notion integration token in `TOOLS.md` for persistent access.\n"},"thoughtSignature":"EjQKMgG+Pvb75iKfTQXporuU0xv8GEGGenv4Db5NiDDyQvhlbR6iB5qLowgqfN6X5lkcCkBe"},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":218866,"output":254,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":219120,"cost":{"input":0.10943299999999999,"output":0.000762,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.11019499999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771342736474}}
