{"type":"message","id":"e9100016","parentId":"326d4996","timestamp":"2026-02-17T23:15:27.097Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"edit_1771370127080_215","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-02-18.md","newText":"- **Security Awareness**: Identified that `openclaw.json` contains plain text secrets (Telegram bot token and gateway auth token), necessitating the strict privacy of the GitHub backup repository.\n- **Troubleshooting**: Fixed duplicated cron briefing messages by disabling redundant \"announce\" delivery modes and ensuring Hugin delivers the reports personally via isolated agent turns.\n- **Workflow Optimization**: Established a 24-hour lookback window (07:00-07:00) for Notion daily briefings to ensure complete data coverage for morning reports.\n- **Urgent Task Identified**: Noted that remediation for `CVE-2025-24813` on servers `ONEKORCRMAP002A` and `ONEKORSACAP01` is due today (Feb 18).\n","oldText":"- **Security Awareness**: Identified that `openclaw.json` contains plain text secrets (Telegram bot token and gateway auth token), necessitating the strict privacy of the GitHub backup repository.\n"},"thoughtSignature":"EjQKMgG+Pvb791kPUbQ6HxMRN8fsbbYKxkqFQAuMA0flSDPnjtjgg2sOt2C2elmPOgbWQIbB"},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-flash","usage":{"input":368750,"output":257,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":369007,"cost":{"input":0.18437499999999998,"output":0.000771,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.18514599999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771370120863}}
{"type":"message","id":"2358b44e","parentId":"e9100016","timestamp":"2026-02-17T23:15:27.103Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"edit_1771370127080_215","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-02-18.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 11 - **System Health**: Clarified that security audit warnings regarding `~/.npm-global/bin/openclaw` or `~/.openclaw/bin` are expected due to the NVM-based installation and do not indicate a real issue.\n 12 - **Automation Refinement**: Changed the `daily-update-check` schedule from 09:00 to 06:00 KST to ensure issues can be fixed before business hours.\n 13 - **Model Identity Correction**: Confirmed that \"Gemini 3\" (Pro/Flash) is indeed the next-generation \"agent-first\" architecture from Google, distinct from and superior to the 1.5 series, featuring Deep Think capabilities and lower latency.\n 14 - **Security Awareness**: Identified that `openclaw.json` contains plain text secrets (Telegram bot token and gateway auth token), necessitating the strict privacy of the GitHub backup repository.\n+15 - **Troubleshooting**: Fixed duplicated cron briefing messages by disabling redundant \"announce\" delivery modes and ensuring Hugin delivers the reports personally via isolated agent turns.\n+16 - **Workflow Optimization**: Established a 24-hour lookback window (07:00-07:00) for Notion daily briefings to ensure complete data coverage for morning reports.\n+17 - **Urgent Task Identified**: Noted that remediation for `CVE-2025-24813` on servers `ONEKORCRMAP002A` and `ONEKORSACAP01` is due today (Feb 18).","firstChangedLine":15},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771370127101}}
