{"type":"message","id":"5322bdda","parentId":"ddbcf6de","timestamp":"2026-02-18T08:08:13.163Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1771402088167_4","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026.2.17\nOpenClaw status\n\nOverview\n┌─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Item            │ Value                                                                                             │\n├─────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Dashboard       │ http://127.0.0.1:18789/                                                                           │\n│ OS              │ linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2 (x64) · node 22.22.0                                     │\n│ Tailscale       │ off                                                                                               │\n│ Channel         │ dev (config)                                                                                      │\n│ Update          │ pnpm · npm latest 2026.2.17                                                                       │\n│ Gateway         │ local · ws://127.0.0.1:18789 (local loopback) · reachable 21ms · auth token · Lfantasial4090      │\n│                 │ (172.26.127.117) app 2026.2.15 linux 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2                           │\n│ Gateway service │ systemd installed · enabled · running (pid 426560, state active)                                  │\n│ Node service    │ systemd not installed                                                                             │\n│ Agents          │ 1 · no bootstraps · sessions 7 · default main active just now                                     │\n│ Memory          │ 0 files · 0 chunks · dirty · sources memory · plugin memory-core · vector unknown · fts ready ·   │\n│                 │ cache on (0)                    