{"type":"message","id":"05dff362","parentId":"6faa5150","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:45:37.174Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Confirming Sub-Agent Usage**\n\nI've confirmed that all four Gemini 3 models are indeed usable as sub-agents within OpenClaw. Any model listed in the `models` configuration, or discovered through the provider, can be assigned this role. This confirms the initial assumption that there is no restriction on which model can be a sub-agent.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"네, 정확합니다! 🦉\n\n리스트에 있는 4가지 모델 모두 **서브 에이전트의 두뇌**로 지정해서 사용할 수 있습니다.\n\n제가 상황에 맞춰서 이렇게 운용할 수 있습니다:\n\n1.  **단순 정보 수집**: \"웹 검색해서 최신 뉴스 좀 모아와\" \n    *   👉 **`Flash`** 서브 에이전트 투입 (빠르고 저렴하게 처리)\n2.  **일반 코딩/문서 작성**: \"이 파이썬 스크립트 좀 짜줘\"\n    *   👉 **`Pro`** 서브 에이전트 투입 (균형 잡힌 성능)\n3.  **심층 분석/설계**: \"Azure 전체 보안 아키텍처 리뷰해줘\"\n    *   👉 **`Pro-high`** 서브 에이전트 투입 (시간이 걸려도 깊게 생각하고 답변)\n\n즉, Sam은 저에게 지시만 내리시면 제가 이 4가지 카드를 적재적소에 꺼내서 가장 효율적으로 업무를 처리해 드립니다. 아주 강력한 전술이죠! 🌌","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":458831,"output":505,"cacheRead":8187,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":467523,"cost":{"input":0.917662,"output":0.00606,"cacheRead":0.0016374000000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.9253593999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771407922120}}
{"type":"message","id":"d491ec32","parentId":"05dff362","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:47:21.971Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"804\",\n  \"sender\": \"5487758242\"\n}\n```\n\n그리고 이런 설정 전체를 언제든 롤백할 수 있게 git 으로 관리할 수 있어? 다음에 문제 생기면 바로 즉시 복구하게 그리고 설정된 폴더 위치나 이런 것들도 같이 저장되서 한번에 복구했으면 해"}],"timestamp":1771408041952}}
{"type":"message","id":"c6537094","parentId":"d491ec32","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:47:35.167Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Envisioning Complete Git Control**\n\nI'm now fully committed to managing OpenClaw's configuration and state through Git. This encompasses not just `openclaw.json` but also the entire workspace, including user metadata and scripts. My goal is instant rollback and streamlined recovery, ensuring comprehensive version control over the whole environment.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"네, 가능합니다. 이미 **`~/.openclaw` 폴더 전체를 Git으로 관리**하고 있으며, 문제가 생겼을 때 즉시 복구할 수 있는 체계를 갖춰두었습니다. 🦉\n\n### 1. 현재 백업 범위\nSam의 요청대로 다음 항목들이 모두 포함된 **전체 시스템 상태**가 `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup` 레포지토리에 저장되고 있습니다:\n*   **시스템 설정**: `openclaw.json` (포트, 채널, 모델 설정 등)\n*   **워크스페이스**: `workspace/` (USER.md, SOUL.md, 스크립트, 디자인 파일 등)\n*   **자동화 설정**: `cron/` (스케줄러 작업 목록)\n*   **인증 및 기기**: `devices/`, `identity/` (연결된 기기 정보)\n*   **에이전트 데이터**: `agents/` (대화 기록 및 세션 정보)\n\n### 2. 즉시 복구 (Rollback) 방법\n만약 설정이 꼬이거나 문제가 생겼을 때, 터미널에서 다음 명령어 한 줄이면 **가장 최근의 정상 상태로 즉시 되돌릴 수 있습니다.**\n\n```bash\n# 최신 상태로 강제 복구 (주의: 로컬의 변경사항은 덮어씌워짐)\ncd ~/.openclaw\ngit fetch origin\ngit reset --hard origin/master\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n### 3. 통째로 복원하기 (새 장비/포맷 후)\n새로운 서버나 PC에서 기존 환경을 그대로 가져오고 싶다면:\n```bash\n# 1. OpenClaw 설치\nnpm i -g openclaw@latest\n\n# 2. 기존 설정 통째로 가져오기\ngit clone https://github.com/Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup.git ~/.openclaw\n\n# 3. 서비스 시작\nopenclaw gateway start\n```\n\n이 방식이면 폴더 위치와 모든 설정이 완벽하게 복원됩니다. Sam의 인프라 관리 원칙(IaC)과 동일한 방식으로 저 자신도 관리되고 있습니다. 🌌","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":467446,"output":728,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":468174,"cost":{"input":0.934892,"output":0.008736,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.9436279999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771408041957}}
{"type":"message","id":"964d547a","parentId":"c6537094","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:48:21.510Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"806\",\n  \"sender\": \"5487758242\"\n}\n```\n\n이 가이드도 있어야 문제 생겼을 때 AI가 보고 참고해서 복구할것 같은데, 이런 내용이 md 파일로 있어?"}],"timestamp":1771408101492}}
{"type":"message","id":"cb3aae9d","parentId":"964d547a","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:48:44.792Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering File Locations**\n\nI'm now thinking specifically about how to document the recovery/rollback guide. I considered `AGENTS.md` and `TOOLS.md` for operational notes, but a dedicated `RECOVERY.md` file seems best. I'm leaning toward adding it to the project root for easy access.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"**Generating Recovery Documentation**\n\nI'm creating a `RECOVERY.md` file in the workspace. It will serve as a comprehensive disaster recovery guide, documenting the Git-based backup system, rollback procedures, and full restoration steps for a fresh environment. This ensures AI or human operators can easily recover the system.\n\n\n[Historical context: a different model called tool \"write\" with arguments: {\n  \"content\": \"# OpenClaw Disaster Recovery Guide\\n\\nThis document outlines the procedures for backing up, rolling back, and fully restoring the OpenClaw environment using the Git-based configuration repository.\\n\\n## 1. Backup Strategy\\n\\n- **Repository**: `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup` (Private)\\n- **Scope**: Entire `~/.openclaw` directory (Configs, Workspace, Memory, Sessions, Identity).\\n- **Automation**: A cron job (`daily-github-backup`) runs daily at 04:00 KST to commit and push changes.\\n\\n## 2. Emergency Rollback (Fixing a Broken State)\\n\\nIf a configuration change breaks the system, use these commands to revert to the last known good state from GitHub.\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Stop the gateway service\\nopenclaw gateway stop\\n\\n# 2. Go to state directory\\ncd ~/.openclaw\\n\\n# 3. Fetch latest history\\ngit fetch origin\\n\\n# 4. Hard reset to match remote master (WARNING: Discards local uncommitted changes)\\ngit reset --hard origin/master\\n\\n# 5. Restart gateway\\nopenclaw gateway start\\n```\\n\\n## 3. Full Restoration (New Machine / Fresh Install)\\n\\nTo restore the entire agent persona and memory on a new server:\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n- Node.js (v20+) & npm/pnpm installed\\n- Git installed and authenticated with GitHub\\n\\n### Restoration Steps\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Install OpenClaw CLI\\nnpm install -g openclaw@latest\\n\\n# 2. Clone the backup repository into the state directory\\n# (Ensure ~/.openclaw does not exist or is empty before cloning)\\ngit clone https://github.com/Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup.git ~/.openclaw\\n\\n# 3. Verify permissions (Optional but recommended)\\nchmod 600 ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\\n\\n# 4. Install the Gateway Service\\nopenclaw gateway install\\n\\n# 5. Start the Gateway\\nopenclaw gateway start\\n\\n# 6. Verify Status\\nopenclaw status --deep\\n```\\n\\n## 4. Manual Backup (Force Push)\\n\\nTo manually trigger a backup before a risky change:\\n\\n```bash\\ncd ~/.openclaw\\ngit add .\\ngit commit -m \\\"Manual backup before critical change\\\"\\ngit push origin master\\n```\\n\\n---\\n*Maintained by Hugin (Owl) for Sam.*\\n\",\n  \"path\": \"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/RECOVERY.md\"\n}. Do not mimic this format - use proper function calling.]","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":468069,"output":970,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":469039,"cost":{"input":0.9361379999999999,"output":0.011640000000000001,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.9477779999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771408101496}}
