{"type":"message","id":"744429a6","parentId":"8e2c8316","timestamp":"2026-02-18T09:52:02.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying Backup Configuration**\n\nI'm now checking the configuration of the daily GitHub backup cron job. I recall mentioning its setup in `MEMORY.md`, but I need to confirm if the cron job itself was actually created. I remember the target time was 04:00 KST, so I'll be looking for any tool calls related to `daily-github-backup`.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"cron_1771408321473_1","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"list"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":468916,"output":267,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":469183,"cost":{"input":0.937832,"output":0.0032040000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.941036}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771408304412}}
