{"type":"message","id":"66886fe8","parentId":"f49a6b9e","timestamp":"2026-02-18T10:12:06.354Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1771409524526_11","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code\tComplete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:08:53Z\nHKUDS/nanobot\t\"🐈 nanobot: The Ultra-Lightweight OpenClaw\"\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:10:38Z\nVoltAgent/awesome-openclaw-skills\tThe awesome collection of OpenClaw Skills. Formerly known as Moltbot, originally Clawdbot.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:08:48Z\nxai-org/x-algorithm\tAlgorithm powering the For You feed on X\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:57:54Z\nsipeed/picoclaw\tTiny, Fast, and Deployable anywhere — automate the mundane, unleash your creativity\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:11:04Z\nvercel-labs/agent-browser\tBrowser automation CLI for AI agents\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:50:19Z\nOthmanAdi/planning-with-files\tClaude Code skill implementing Manus-style persistent markdown planning — the workflow pattern behind the $2B acquisition.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:10:20Z\nsickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills\tThe Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:11:00Z\nZhuLinsen/daily_stock_analysis\tLLM驱动的 A/H/美股智能分析器，多数据源行情 + 实时新闻 + Gemini 决策仪表盘 + 多渠道推送，零成本，纯白嫖，定时运行\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:53:36Z\nzeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw\tFast, small, and fully autonomous AI assistant infrastructure — deploy anywhere, swap anything 🦀\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:12:02Z"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":936,"aggregated":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code\tComplete Claude Code configuration collection - agents, skills, hooks, commands, rules, MCPs. Battle-tested configs from an Anthropic hackathon winner.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:08:53Z\nHKUDS/nanobot\t\"🐈 nanobot: The Ultra-Lightweight OpenClaw\"\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:10:38Z\nVoltAgent/awesome-openclaw-skills\tThe awesome collection of OpenClaw Skills. Formerly known as Moltbot, originally Clawdbot.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:08:48Z\nxai-org/x-algorithm\tAlgorithm powering the For You feed on X\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:57:54Z\nsipeed/picoclaw\tTiny, Fast, and Deployable anywhere — automate the mundane, unleash your creativity\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:11:04Z\nvercel-labs/agent-browser\tBrowser automation CLI for AI agents\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:50:19Z\nOthmanAdi/planning-with-files\tClaude Code skill implementing Manus-style persistent markdown planning — the workflow pattern behind the $2B acquisition.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:10:20Z\nsickn33/antigravity-awesome-skills\tThe Ultimate Collection of 800+ Agentic Skills for Claude Code/Antigravity/Cursor. Battle-tested, high-performance skills for AI agents including official skills from Anthropic and Vercel.\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:11:00Z\nZhuLinsen/daily_stock_analysis\tLLM驱动的 A/H/美股智能分析器，多数据源行情 + 实时新闻 + Gemini 决策仪表盘 + 多渠道推送，零成本，纯白嫖，定时运行\tpublic\t2026-02-18T09:53:36Z\nzeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw\tFast, small, and fully autonomous AI assistant infrastructure — deploy anywhere, swap anything 🦀\tpublic\t2026-02-18T10:12:02Z","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771409526349}}
{"type":"message","id":"c7ec2583","parentId":"66886fe8","timestamp":"2026-02-18T10:12:17.143Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026년 2월 현재, 깃헙에서 가장 뜨거운 관심을 받고 있는 프로젝트들을 정리해 드립니다. 🦉 \n\n올해는 특히 **AI 에이전트 도구**와 **오픈소스 알고리즘**이 트렌드를 주도하고 있네요.\n\n### 🔥 2026년 신규 Trending & Awesome Repos\n\n1.  **`affaan-m/everything-claude-code`**\n    *   **내용**: Claude Code의 모든 설정(에이전트, 스킬, 훅, 룰)을 집대성한 컬렉션입니다.\n    *   **특징**: Anthropic 해커톤 우승자의 실전 설정이 담겨 있어, 저(Hugin)를 더 강력하게 튜닝하고 싶을 때 참고하기 좋습니다.\n\n2.  **`xai-org/x-algorithm`**\n    *   **내용**: X(구 트위터)의 'For You' 피드를 구동하는 추천 알고리즘 소스코드입니다.\n    *   **특징**: 일론 머스크의 xAI 팀이 공개했으며, 대규모 추천 시스템의 내부 로직을 공부할 수 있는 귀중한 자료입니다.\n\n3.  **`vercel-labs/agent-browser`**\n    *   **내용**: AI 에이전트를 위한 브라우저 자동화 CLI 도구입니다.\n    *   **특징**: 제가 웹사이트를 돌아다니며 정보를 수집할 때 사용하는 기술의 기반이 되는 프로젝트입니다.\n\n4.  **`VoltAgent/awesome-openclaw-skills`**\n    *   **내용**: OpenClaw(바로 저!)에서 사용할 수 있는 다양한 '스킬'들을 모아놓은 Awesome 리스트입니다.\n    *   **특징**: 새로운 기능을 저에게 추가하고 싶으실 때 여기서 쇼핑하듯 골라보시면 됩니다.\n\n5.  **`HKUDS/nanobot`**\n    *   **내용**: 초경량 버전의 OpenClaw 구현체입니다.\n    *   **특징**: 무거운 기능은 덜어내고 핵심 기능만 빠르게 돌리고 싶어 하는 개발자들에게 인기입니다.\n\n---\n\n**🦉 후긴의 추천:**\nSam이 인프라/DevSecOps 매니저이시니, **`everything-claude-code`**를 참고해서 저의 `AGENTS.md`나 스킬 설정을 고도화하거나, **`x-algorithm`**을 통해 대규모 트래픽 처리 로직을 살펴보시는 것도 흥미로우실 것 같습니다. 관심 가는 레포가 있다면 제가 내용을 더 깊이 파서 요약해 드릴까요? 🌌"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":1578,"output":591,"cacheRead":483848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":486017,"cost":{"input":0.003156,"output":0.007092,"cacheRead":0.09676960000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.10701760000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771409526354}}
