{"type":"message","id":"86cccc67","parentId":"1a6fd478","timestamp":"2026-02-18T14:25:18.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering Model Override**\n\nI'm currently focused on how to force the use of the `Gemini 3 Pro` model to demonstrate the \"Pro model usage indicator\" as Sam requested. The default `Flash` model is getting in the way, so I need a specific override mechanism to choose the pro model for the demonstration. My goal is to ensure this will be visible.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"sessions_spawn_1771424717703_5","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"model":"google-antigravity/gemini-3-pro-high","systemPrompt":"You are a sub-agent powered by Gemini 3 Pro. You MUST start your response with exactly: \"⚡ [Gemini 3 Pro 모델로 분석 중...]\" followed by a new line. Then, write a short, profound poem about \"Digital Memory and Human Logic\".","task":"Write a short poem about Digital Memory and Human Logic."},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":572369,"output":361,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":572730,"cost":{"input":1.144738,"output":0.004332,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.14907}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771424654861}}
