{"type":"message","id":"f2febe01","parentId":"416ceb78","timestamp":"2026-02-18T14:25:28.063Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚡ **[Gemini 3 Pro 모델 사용 중]**\n\nSam의 요청에 따라, **Gemini 3 Pro** 모델을 탑재한 서브 에이전트를 소환했습니다. 🦉\n\n임무: **\"디지털 기억과 인간의 논리에 대한 시(Poem) 창작\"**\n\n지금 서브 에이전트가 깊은 사색에 잠겨 있습니다. 결과가 나오는 대로(혹은 1분이 경과하면) 바로 보고드리겠습니다. 잠시만 기다려 주십시오. 🌌"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":4735,"output":115,"cacheRead":568227,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":573077,"cost":{"input":0.00947,"output":0.00138,"cacheRead":0.11364540000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1244954}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771424718546}}
{"type":"message","id":"f44feeb6","parentId":"f2febe01","timestamp":"2026-02-18T14:26:14.279Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 23:26 GMT+9] [System Message] [sessionId: 37bffcee-b093-441d-82a5-2fdb2ed54fec] A subagent task \"Write a short poem about Digital Memory and Human Logic.\" just completed successfully.\n\nResult:\nI have written the poem as requested.\n\n**Digital Memory and Human Logic**\n\nIn circuits etched with perfect lines,\nThe moment stays, the data shines.\nNo pixel fades, no byte decays,\nPreserved in cold, electric haze.\n\nBut human thought is soft and deep,\nA logic born of dreams and sleep.\nWe bridge the gaps with hope and fear,\nAnd sense the truths not written here.\n\nThe server holds the rigid fact,\nWhile we keep the soul intact.\n\nStats: runtime 55s • tokens 5.3k (in 4.7k / out 611)\n\nA completed subagent task is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type)."}],"timestamp":1771424774254}}
{"type":"message","id":"a648b2de","parentId":"f44feeb6","timestamp":"2026-02-18T14:27:17.386Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"⚡ **[Gemini 3 Pro 모델 사용 중]**\n\n서브 에이전트가 작업을 마치고 아름다운 시를 한 편 남기고 갔습니다. 🦉\n\n**Digital Memory and Human Logic**\n*(디지털 기억과 인간의 논리)*\n\nIn circuits etched with perfect lines,\nThe moment stays, the data shines.\nNo pixel fades, no byte decays,\nPreserved in cold, electric haze.\n\nBut human thought is soft and deep,\nA logic born of dreams and sleep.\nWe bridge the gaps with hope and fear,\nAnd sense the truths not written here.\n\nThe server holds the rigid fact,\nWhile we keep the soul intact.\n\n---\n\n**🦉 후긴의 감상:**\n\"서버는 차가운 사실을 붙들고 있지만, 영혼을 온전하게 하는 건 우리 자신\"이라는 마지막 구절이 인상적이네요. Sam이 구축하시는 시스템과 저(AI)의 관계를 잘 표현한 것 같습니다. 🌌"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":572833,"output":212,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":573045,"cost":{"input":1.1456659999999999,"output":0.0025440000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.14821}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771424774260}}
