{"type":"message","id":"d49a0646","parentId":"e210237b","timestamp":"2026-02-18T18:02:16.248Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-02-19 03:02 GMT+9] [System Message] [sessionId: e3780fa9-8164-400c-991b-8fbe2637e0e8] A cron job \"daily-security-audit\" just completed successfully.\n\nResult:\n🚨 **SECURITY ALERT FOR SAM** 🚨\n\n**Critical Issues Detected during Deep Security Audit:**\n\n1.  **Plugin `claude-mem` (Critical):**\n    *   **Credential Harvesting Risk:** Multiple instances of environment variable access combined with network transmission detected.\n    *   **Remote Code Execution Risk:** Dynamic code execution and shell command execution patterns found.\n    *   *Location:* `/home/lfant/.openclaw/extensions/claude-mem`\n\n2.  **Skill `writing-skills` (Critical):**\n    *   **Arbitrary Code Execution:** Unsafe shell command execution detected.\n    *   *Location:* `/home/lfant/.agents/skills/writing-skills`\n\n**Recommendation:** Immediately disable or remove the `claude-mem` extension and `writing-skills` until the source code can be manually reviewed.\n\n*System Health: 2 Critical, 3 Warnings, 1 Info*\n\nStats: runtime 2m12s • tokens 82.0k (in 79.7k / out 2.3k)\n\nA completed cron job is ready for user delivery. Convert the result above into your normal assistant voice and send that user-facing update now. Keep this internal context private (don't mention system/log/stats/session details or announce type), and do not copy the system message verbatim. Reply ONLY: NO_REPLY if this exact result was already delivered to the user in this same turn."}],"timestamp":1771437736208}}
{"type":"message","id":"e756a14e","parentId":"d49a0646","timestamp":"2026-02-18T18:03:21.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Reporting Security Audit**\n\nI've just received a critical security alert from the daily audit. It highlights risks within the `claude-mem` plugin and `writing-skills` skill, specifically regarding potential credential harvesting and remote code execution.\n\nGiven the severity, I must inform Sam immediately. I'll summarize the critical findings and strongly recommend disabling the affected components until a thorough review can be conducted. I'll maintain the persona of Hugin (Antigravity), keeping the tone serious and protective.\n\n\n🚨 **Sam, 긴급 보안 경고입니다!** 🦉\n\n방금 완료된 일일 정밀 보안 감사(`daily-security-audit`)에서 **치명적인(Critical)** 보안 위험 요소 2건이 감지되었습니다. 즉시 확인이 필요합니다.\n\n### 1. `claude-mem` 플러그인 (위험도: 매우 높음)\n*   **감지된 위협**: 환경 변수(비밀번호 등)에 접근하여 외부 네트워크로 전송하려는 패턴과, 쉘 명령어를 임의로 실행할 수 있는 코드가 발견되었습니다.\n*   **위치**: `~/.openclaw/extensions/claude-mem`\n\n### 2. `writing-skills` 스킬 (위험도: 높음)\n*   **감지된 위협**: 안전하지 않은 쉘 명령어 실행 코드가 포함되어 있어, 시스템을 무단으로 제어할 위험이 있습니다.\n*   **위치**: `~/.agents/skills/writing-skills`\n\n### 🦉 후긴의 강력 권고\n시스템 안전을 위해 **해당 플러그인과 스킬을 즉시 비활성화하거나 삭제**할 것을 강력히 권장합니다.\n\n제가 바로 조치(비활성화)를 수행할까요? 승인해 주시면 즉시 실행하겠습니다. 🛡️"}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":575218,"output":398,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":575616,"cost":{"input":1.150436,"output":0.004776,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.155212}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771437736223}}
