{"type":"message","id":"7a85db58","parentId":"bfaa65e8","timestamp":"2026-02-18T23:09:46.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying Cron Job Execution**\n\nI'm currently verifying if the cron jobs ran today, specifically because Sam suspects they didn't. I'm focusing on confirming the execution of the `daily-security-audit` job, which was scheduled for 03:00 K. My immediate next step is checking the cron logs or job listings to find its last run time.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"cron_1771456185505_43","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"list"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":580736,"output":205,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":580941,"cost":{"input":1.1614719999999998,"output":0.00246,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.1639319999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771456172070}}
{"type":"message","id":"e6c9161f","parentId":"7a85db58","timestamp":"2026-02-18T23:09:46.117Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"cron_1771456185505_43","toolName":"cron","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"78f50a18-690a-4667-a12c-99a01398515c\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"daily-security-audit\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"notify\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1771254363238,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1771437753611,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 3 * * *\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"message\": \"Run 'openclaw security audit --deep'. If any critical issues are found, alert Sam immediately. Otherwise, provide a brief summary of the system health.\",\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771524000000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1771437604008,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 149603,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1,\n        \"lastError\": \"cron announce delivery failed\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:main\",\n      \"name\": \"daily-github-backup\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1771408374779,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1771441224648,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 4 * * *\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"message\": \"Execute the backup script at /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/backup_to_github.sh using the exec tool. If it fails, report the error. If successful, simply confirm the backup is done.