ther skill). 2. Brief system status overview. 3. Any urgent notifications or tasks from memory. Keep it sharp and helpful.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771538400000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1771452000005,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 83680,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"notion-daily-briefing\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"notify\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1771342778984,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1771455620707,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"message\": \"Run the python script `/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py` to fetch the latest Notion tasks from yesterday 07:00 to today 07:00. Present the results clearly to Sam in your normal assistant voice (Antigravity 🌌).\",\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"none\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771542000000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1771455602938,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 17769,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"periodic-memory-maintenance\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"notify\": false,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1771254363257,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1771254363257,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"expr\": \"0 23 * * 0\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"Read through recent memory files in 'workspace/memory/' and distill key learnings, decisions, and context into 'MEMORY.md'. Ensure the long-term memory remains curated and useful.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771768800000\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"jobs":[{"id":"78f50a18-690a-4667-a12c-99a01398515c","agentId":"main","name":"daily-security-audit","enabled":true,"notify":true,"createdAtMs":1771254363238,"updatedAtMs":1771437753611,"schedule":{"tz":"Asia/Seoul","expr":"0 3 * * *","kind":"cron"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"message":"Run 'openclaw security audit --deep'. If any critical issues are found, alert Sam immediately. Otherwise, provide a brief summary of the system health.","kind":"agentTurn"},"delivery":{"mode":"announce"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1771524000000,"lastRunAtMs":1771437604008,"lastStatus":"error","lastDurationMs":149603,"consecutiveErrors":1,"lastError":"cron announce delivery failed"}},{"id":"52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93","agentId":"main","sessionKey":"agent:main:main","name":"daily-github-backup","enabled":true,"createdAtMs":1771408374779,"updatedAtMs":1771441224648,"schedule":{"kind":"cron","tz":"Asia/Seoul","expr":"0 4 * * *"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"message":"Execute the backup script at /home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/backup_to_github.sh using the exec tool. If it fails, report the error. If successful, simply confirm the backup is done.","kind":"agentTurn"},"delivery":{"mode":"none"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1771527600000,"lastRunAtMs":1771441202934,"lastStatus":"ok","lastDurationMs":21714,"consecutiveErrors":0}},{"id":"dc1f52da-a247-4c7c-8ad8-c3f0d5ca71fc","agentId":"main","name":"daily-update-check","enabled":true,"notify":true,"createdAtMs":1771254363249,"updatedAtMs":1771448453933,"schedule":{"tz":"Asia/Seoul","kind":"cron","expr":"0 6 * * *"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"message":"Check for OpenClaw and skills updates using 'openclaw update status' and 'npx skills check'. If updates are available, verify that Telegram channel is synced and notify Sam with the update details.","kind":"agentTurn"},"delivery":{"mode":"announce"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1771534800000,"lastRunAtMs":1771448405889,"lastStatus":"ok","lastDurationMs":48044,"consecutiveErrors":0}},{"id":"eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260","agentId":"main","name":"daily-morning-briefing","enabled":true,"notify":true,"createdAtMs":1771254363268,"updatedAtMs":1771452083685,"schedule":{"expr":"0 7 * * *","kind":"cron","tz":"Asia/Seoul"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"kind":"agentTurn","message":"It's 7 AM. Provide a morning briefing for Sam: 1. Current weather in Seoul (using weather skill). 2. Brief system status overview. 3. Any urgent notifications or tasks from memory. Keep it sharp and helpful."},"delivery":{"mode":"none"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1771538400000,"lastRunAtMs":1771452000005,"lastStatus":"ok","lastDurationMs":83680,"consecutiveErrors":0}},{"id":"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89","agentId":"main","name":"notion-daily-briefing","enabled":true,"notify":true,"createdAtMs":1771342778984,"updatedAtMs":1771455620707,"schedule":{"kind":"cron","expr":"0 8 * * *","tz":"Asia/Seoul"},"sessionTarget":"isolated","wakeMode":"now","payload":{"message":"Run the python script `/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py` to fetch the latest Notion tasks from yesterday 07:00 to today 07:00. Present the results clearly to Sam in your normal assistant voice (Antigravity 🌌).","kind":"agentTurn"},"delivery":{"mode":"none"},"state":{"nextRunAtMs":1771542000000,"lastRunAtMs":1771455602938,"lastStatus":"ok","lastDurationMs":17769,"consecutiveErrors":0}},{"id":"07b6a467-2277-4376-8c4c-b8ae1a7ac74f","agentId":"main","name":"periodic-memory-maintenance","enabled":true,"notify":fa