{"type":"message","id":"9559fbec","parentId":"8f53817a","timestamp":"2026-02-18T23:19:58.972Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Interpreting Sam's Message**\n\nI'm now focusing on Sam's message, \"Can you see the message now?\" It seems he's either checking if a previous message went through or is testing the connection after the recent cron job problems. The context helps: I received message 872 successfully, but there was a previous interruption. I'm trying to determine the specific problem.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"네, Sam! 🦉 지금 보내신 메시지(\"지금 메세지 보여?\") 아주 잘 보입니다.\n\n방금 전까지 대화했던 내용들도 모두 정상적으로 수신했습니다. 혹시 제가 놓친 메시지가 있거나 반응이 없었던 적이 있었나요?\n\n시스템 상태는 현재 **정상(Active)**이며, 텔레그램 연결도 **양호(OK)**합니다. 🌌","textSignature":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":587492,"output":339,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":587831,"cost":{"input":1.174984,"output":0.0040680000000000004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.179052}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771456784557}}
