{"type":"message","id":"c5e1623b","parentId":"49415f89","timestamp":"2026-02-18T23:20:38.728Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Examining System Logs**\n\nI'm now focusing on the OpenClaw logs, to diagnose potential messaging failures or assess system health. I plan to check either the standard log location, typically `~/.openclaw/logs/`, or potentially utilize the `openclaw logs` command. The goal is to pinpoint any specific issues. I intend to use the `exec` tool to run the log analysis.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1771456838262_47","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -F /home/lfant/.openclaw/logs/"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":579520,"output":192,"cacheRead":8244,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":587956,"cost":{"input":1.1590399999999998,"output":0.002304,"cacheRead":0.0016488000000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.1629927999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771456828255}}
