{"type":"message","id":"c2d93857","parentId":"25a4e883","timestamp":"2026-02-18T23:25:09.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Analyzing Daily Briefings**\n\nI'm currently distinguishing between two daily briefing types: the 7 AM `daily-morning-briefing`, which covers weather, system status, and tasks; and the 8 AM `notion-daily-briefing`, which focuses on Notion tasks. My analysis suggests Sam is interested in re-running one of these, although which one is the next step to discern.\n\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"네, 알겠습니다! 🦉\n\n오늘 아침에 전달되지 못했던 **모닝 브리핑(날씨 + 시스템 상태)**과 **노션 업무 브리핑**을 지금 즉시 수동으로 실행해서 다시 보고드리겠습니다.\n\n지금 시간 기준으로 최신 정보를 담아오겠습니다. 잠시만 기다려 주세요! 🌌\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"cron_1771457109461_1","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"run","jobId":"eb4407c8-7e9a-4d66-b956-2695d5aee260"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"cron_1771457109663_2","name":"cron","arguments":{"jobId":"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89","action":"run"}},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":560274,"output":435,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":560709,"cost":{"input":1.1205479999999999,"output":0.00522,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.1257679999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771457098296}}
