{"type":"message","id":"dece8f19","parentId":"c7cf3a0a","timestamp":"2026-02-19T00:05:44.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Fetching OpenClaw Issues**\n\nI'm focusing on retrieving the newest reported issues from the `openclaw/openclaw` GitHub repository. I'll utilize the `github` skill or `gh` CLI for this. My initial assumption is that `openclaw/openclaw` is the target repository, but I'll double-check to confirm it isn't `VoltAgent/openclaw` or a similar variant for complete accuracy.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1771459544062_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue list --repo openclaw/openclaw --limit 5 --state open --order desc --sort created"},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":""}],"api":"google-gemini-cli","provider":"google-antigravity","model":"gemini-3-pro-high","usage":{"input":569637,"output":257,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":569894,"cost":{"input":1.139274,"output":0.003084,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":1.142358}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771459530485}}
{"type":"message","id":"93ab3490","parentId":"dece8f19","timestamp":"2026-02-19T00:05:44.627Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1771459544062_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown flag: --order\n\nUsage:  gh issue list [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --app string         Filter by GitHub App author\n  -a, --assignee string    Filter by assignee\n  -A, --author string      Filter by author\n  -q, --jq expression      Filter JSON output using a jq expression\n      --json fields        Output JSON with the specified fields\n  -l, --label strings      Filter by label\n  -L, --limit int          Maximum number of issues to fetch (default 30)\n      --mention string     Filter by mention\n  -m, --milestone string   Filter by milestone number or title\n  -S, --search query       Search issues with query\n  -s, --state string       Filter by state: {open|closed|all} (default \"open\")\n  -t, --template string    Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n  -w, --web                List issues in the web browser\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":98,"aggregated":"unknown flag: --order\n\nUsage:  gh issue list [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --app string         Filter by GitHub App author\n  -a, --assignee string    Filter by assignee\n  -A, --author string      Filter by author\n  -q, --jq expression      Filter JSON output using a jq expression\n      --json fields        Output JSON with the specified fields\n  -l, --label strings      Filter by label\n  -L, --limit int          Maximum number of issues to fetch (default 30)\n      --mention string     Filter by mention\n  -m, --milestone string   Filter by milestone number or title\n  -S, --search query       Search issues with query\n  -s, --state string       Filter by state: {open|closed|all} (default \"open\")\n  -t, --template string    Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n  -w, --web                List issues in the web browser\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771459544615}}
