{"type":"message","id":"7fba8fd9","parentId":"0f5aa99c","timestamp":"2026-02-20T08:54:14.715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating GLM-4 Agent**\n\nI'm currently identifying a potential confusion regarding **\"GLM-4.0\"**. Sam's previous inquiries about `claude-mem` and `daily-morning-briefing` (Notion tasks) were for OpenClaw/Google Antigravity. Now, he's asking about **\"glm-4.7\"**. This might be the *LLM Agent* recently discussed in tech circles (OpenAI or similar).\n\nHowever, looking at my available tools and `openclaw.json`, I don't see a direct entry for \"glm-4.7\" in the `models` or `agents` configuration. I'm assuming he might be referring to the *same* agent class or *provider*.\n\nLet's check if \"Google Antigravity\" provider has a new model alias for glm-4.7.\nOr, maybe he saw \"glm\" in the logs (which we know is *Gemini*).\n\nLet's play it safe and ask for clarification if I'm right, or just explain what \"glm-4.7\" typically is based on my current knowledge.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Sam, **\"glm-4.7\"**은 제가 가지고 있는 기술 용어가 아닙니다. 🦉\n\n현재 제 설정(`openclaw.json`)에 있는 모델은 다음과 같습니다:\n*   **주요**: `google-antigravity/gemini-3-pro-high` (Antigravity의 최신 Gemini 3.5 모델)\n*   **Flash**: `google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash`\n\n혹시 다른 종류의 AI 에이전트를 말씀하신다면, 예를 들어주세요! (예: \"이거 GPT-4인가요?\", \"이거 LLaMA 3 인가요?\")</final>"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":137213,"output":644,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":137857,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771577629819}}
